# Everything the image does not need, which is nearly everything: the build copies `pyproject.toml`,
# `README.md` and `src/` and nothing else. Listed rather than left out so that adding a directory to
# the repository cannot quietly enlarge the image — and so a database or a config from a local test
# run can never be baked into one.
.git
.github
.venv
venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.log
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.mypy_cache
dist
build
*.egg-info
tests
tools
docs
examples
conf
b3.yaml
plugin_*.yaml
# The gitignored planning documents, which are not published and not in an image either.
DESIGN.md
PARITY.md
TODO.md
